---
import StudioLayout from '../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import FantasyGallery from '../../components/FantasyGallery.astro';
import { gameUIPacks } from '../../data/game-ui-packs';
export function getStaticPaths() { return gameUIPacks.map(pack => ({ params: { slug: pack.slug }, props: { pack } })); }
const { pack } = Astro.props;
---
<StudioLayout title={`${pack.name} — Game UI Packs | Strategic Sloth`} description={pack.description}>
  <div class={`pack-page ${pack.theme}`}>
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/#game-ui-packs">Game UI packs</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>{pack.name}</span></nav>
      <section class="pack-hero" aria-labelledby="pack-title">
        <FantasyGallery modern={pack.theme === 'modern'} orbital={pack.theme === 'orbital'} dusk={pack.theme === 'dusk'} neon={pack.theme === 'neon'} haven={pack.theme === 'haven'} ash={pack.theme === 'ash'} cozy={pack.theme === 'cozy'} military={pack.theme === 'military'} pirate={pack.theme === 'pirate'} />
        <div class="product-summary"><p class="eyebrow">GAME UI COLLECTION / {pack.label.toUpperCase()}</p><h1 id="pack-title">{pack.name}</h1><p class="tagline">{pack.tagline}</p><p>{pack.description}</p><div class="release-note"><strong>In planning</strong><span>Release date and pricing to be announced.</span></div><a class="button" href="#contents">Explore planned contents <span>↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Tell us what you need <span>↗</span></a><dl><div><dt>Designed for</dt><dd>{pack.audience}</dd></div><div><dt>Collection direction</dt><dd>{pack.screens.length} proposed screen types + reusable components</dd></div><div><dt>Availability</dt><dd>Not yet available to purchase or download</dd></div></dl></div>
      </section>
      <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="Pack details"><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#contents">Pack contents</a><a href="#workflow">UX & workflow</a><a href="#specifications">Formats & compatibility</a><a href="#questions">FAQ</a></nav>
      <section class="detail-section overview" id="overview"><div><p class="eyebrow">DESIGNED AS A SYSTEM</p><h2>More than a<br/>collection of buttons.</h2></div><div><p>{pack.audience}</p><p>The plan is to carry one visual language through complete screens, individual controls, and the moments between them. Matching states and documented screen flows will help you adapt the interface to your game.</p><p>Layouts, components, and interaction guidance are proposed together. Final contents will be confirmed before release.</p></div></section>
      <section class="detail-section" id="contents"><p class="eyebrow">THE PROPOSED COLLECTION</p><h2>What we’re planning.</h2><div class="contents-grid"><article><span class="content-index">01 / SCREENS</span><h3>From first click to next step.</h3><ul>{pack.screens.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article><article><span class="content-index">02 / COMPONENTS</span><h3>One consistent toolkit.</h3><ul>{pack.components.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article><article><span class="content-index">03 / HANDOFF</span><h3>The details to build with.</h3><ul><li>Organized editable source files</li><li>Transparent image exports</li><li>Scalable frame / 9-slice guidance</li><li>Color, typography, and spacing notes</li><li>Component state reference</li><li>Quick start and file inventory</li></ul></article></div></section>
      <section class="detail-section" id="workflow"><p class="eyebrow">UI + UX, TOGETHER</p><h2>Make the next action clear.</h2><p class="section-lede">A proposed interaction flow for this collection, with focus, feedback, and a predictable way back.</p><ol class="flow-list">{pack.flow.map((step, i) => <li><span>0{i + 1}</span><p>{step}</p></li>)}</ol><div class="ux-note"><strong>Built into the design brief</strong><p>{pack.theme === 'pirate' ? 'Distinct heading and wind indicators, labeled hull and reload states, clear treasure marker changes, readable chart legends, explicit upgrade costs, and crew contracts that separate hiring fees from daily wages.' : pack.theme === 'military' ? 'An unobstructed aiming area, readable compass headings, explicit loadout compatibility, coordinate grids with clear legends, labeled team states, and adjustable HUD contrast and scale.' : pack.theme === 'cozy' ? 'Large dialogue text, labeled emotions, readable seasonal dates and shop hours, explicit buy and sell totals, protected favorite items, and gentle reminders that pair icons with words.' : pack.theme === 'ash' ? 'Readable labels over weathered materials, explicit weight and durability values, distinct reserve and exposure gauges, material shortages explained before crafting, and warnings that combine icons with text.' : pack.theme === 'haven' ? 'Readable resource totals, explicit costs and capacity limits, labeled chart axes, map legends with patterns and icons, visible pause and speed states, and predictable ways to cancel placement or return to the settlement.' : pack.theme === 'neon' ? 'A clear aiming area, readable ammo and armor, adjustable HUD scale and reticles, remappable inputs, touch-safe spacing, and squad indicators that pair icons with labels.' : pack.theme === 'dusk' ? 'Large touch targets, thumb-friendly controls, mirrored left-handed layouts, safe-area spacing, visible pressed states, readable labels, and indicators that combine icons with color.' : 'Visible focus, readable labels, states that do not rely on color alone, room for longer text, and layouts reviewed at different screen sizes.'} Implemented navigation and accessibility still need testing inside your game.</p></div></section>
      <section class="detail-section specs" id="specifications"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BUILD</p><h2>A clear handoff.</h2><p>We’ll publish exact formats, supported versions, and dependencies with the finished pack.</p></div><dl><div><dt>Asset delivery</dt><dd>Editable source and transparent image exports are planned. Exact formats are not finalized.</dd></div><div><dt>Game engines</dt><dd>Engine packages have not been announced. Unity, Unreal, and Godot compatibility is not yet verified.</dd></div><div><dt>SliceForge</dt><dd>A customization workflow is planned. Native project delivery and one-click opening are not yet confirmed.</dd></div><div><dt>Game behavior</dt><dd>Visual assets and UX guidance are the initial scope. Game logic and engine integration are separate.</dd></div><div><dt>License & updates</dt><dd>Commercial-use terms, team scope, font dependencies, and update policy will be published before sale.</dd></div></dl></section>
      <section class="forge-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">TAKE YOUR OWN DIRECTION</p><h2>Meet SliceForge.</h2><p>Explore editable screens, reusable components, and UI kit exports. Start shaping your interface while this collection takes form.</p></div><a class="button" href={`https://www.sliceforge.io/?utm_source=strategicsloth&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=game_ui_packs&utm_content=${pack.slug}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore SliceForge <span>↗</span></a></section>
      <section class="detail-section faq" id="questions"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW DETAILS</p><h2>Before the first release.</h2><details><summary>Can I buy or download this pack now?</summary><p>Not yet. This page shares the planned direction and contents. Pricing, a sample, and purchase options will be added when the pack is ready.</p></details><details><summary>Are the previews actual game screenshots?</summary><p>These are visual concept mockups, not screenshots of finished assets or an engine integration. Release previews will show the actual delivered files.</p></details><details><summary>Will I need a SliceForge subscription?</summary><p>The proposed pack is a separate product. No paid SliceForge subscription requirement is planned. Any optional customization workflow and its requirements will be documented before release.</p></details><details><summary>Can I request a screen or engine format?</summary><p>Yes. <a href="/contact/">Contact the studio</a> with your game genre, engine, and the screens you need. Requests help prioritize the first releases.</p></details></section>
      <section class="related"><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE COLLECTION</p><div>{gameUIPacks.filter(other => other.slug !== pack.slug).map(other => <a href={`/game-ui/${other.slug}/`}><span><small>{other.label}</small><strong>{other.name}</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div></section>
    </div>
  </div>
</StudioLayout>

<style>
  .pack-page{--accent:#bcf18e;--board:#24372f;--board-ink:#edf5e9}.fantasy{--accent:#eed18e;--board:#302e25;--board-ink:#fff1d8}.orbital{--accent:#9cdff0;--board:#182e3e;--board-ink:#e0f7ff}.breadcrumb{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:32px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.breadcrumb a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.pack-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.45fr 1fr;gap:48px;padding:12px 0 65px;align-items:start}.gallery{min-width:0}.concept-board{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 30%,#ffffff0c,transparent 65%),var(--board);color:var(--board-ink);border-radius:16px;padding:28px;min-height:480px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px}.concept-board[hidden]{display:none}.board-top,.board-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;font:9px monospace;letter-spacing:1px}.board-bottom{opacity:.65}.screen-composition{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:28px}.mock-menu h2{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:14px 0}.concept-board p{color:var(--board-ink);opacity:.7;font-size:12px}.tiny{font:9px monospace;letter-spacing:1.5px;display:block}.menu-options{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:24px 0 18px}.mock-option{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #ffffff35;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;color:var(--board-ink);background:#ffffff06}.mock-option.selected{background:var(--accent);color:#1d2c26;border-color:var(--accent)}.side-panel{border:1px solid #ffffff26;padding:24px 16px;text-align:center;border-radius:50% 50% 8px 8px;background:#ffffff04}.emblem{font-size:70px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--accent)}.side-panel strong{display:block;margin:12px 0}.meter{height:6px;background:#ffffff1c;margin:20px 0}.meter i{display:block;background:var(--accent);height:100%;width:73%}.meter.short i{width:44%}.symbols{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin:20px 0}.symbols span{border:1px solid #ffffff30;padding:8px;color:var(--accent)}.gallery-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:14px 0}.gallery-controls button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;border-radius:8px;text-align:left;padding:14px;font-size:11px}.gallery-controls button span{margin-left:10px}.gallery-controls button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);border-color:var(--ink)}.caption{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}.component-sheet,.state-sheet{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px}.component-sheet .tiny,.state-sheet .tiny{margin-bottom:14px}.component-sheet .mock-option{margin-top:10px}.sample-panel{border:1px solid #ffffff30;padding:18px}.sample-panel h3{font-size:22px;margin:12px 0}.state-hover{background:#ffffff20}.state-focus{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}.state-pressed{background:#101c15;transform:translateY(2px)}.state-selected{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}.state-disabled{opacity:.35}.product-summary h1{font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,58px);margin:16px 0 22px}.product-summary .eyebrow{font-size:9px}.tagline{font-size:21px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:16px}.product-summary>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.tagline){font-size:14px}.release-note{display:grid;gap:4px;border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0;margin:25px 0}.release-note strong{font-size:16px}.release-note span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.product-summary>.button{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.product-summary>.text-link{margin:18px 0}.product-summary dl{margin:8px 0 0}dl>div{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0}dt{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}dd{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.section-nav{display:flex;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:22px 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px}.section-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.detail-section{padding:64px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:100px}.detail-section h2{font-size:40px}.overview,.specs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.35fr;gap:70px}.overview p+p{margin-top:18px}.overview p,.specs p{font-size:15px}.contents-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;margin-top:36px}.content-index{font:10px monospace;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted)}.contents-grid h3{font-size:25px;margin:18px 0}.contents-grid ul{padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:2}.section-lede{margin-top:20px;max-width:650px}.flow-list{list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;margin:35px 0}.flow-list span{font:24px monospace;color:#647459}.flow-list p{font-size:14px;margin-top:16px}.ux-note{padding:24px;background:#e9ece2;border-radius:10px}.ux-note p{font-size:14px;margin-top:10px}.specs p{margin-top:20px}.specs dl{margin:0}.specs dl>div:first-child{padding-top:0}.forge-band{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px;background:#e2ead8;border-radius:16px;padding:40px;margin-top:60px}.forge-band h2{font-size:40px}.forge-band p:last-child{max-width:590px;margin-top:20px;font-size:14px}.forge-band .button{flex-shrink:0}.faq details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 0}.faq h2{margin-bottom:20px}.faq summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:500}.faq details p{font-size:14px;margin-top:14px;max-width:800px}.faq a{text-decoration:underline}.related{padding:50px 0 70px}.related>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.related a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px;border-radius:12px}.related small,.related strong{display:block}.related small{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}.related strong{font-size:20px;font-weight:500}summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6c52a8;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:1100px){.pack-hero{gap:28px;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr}.concept-board{padding:20px}.screen-composition{gap:15px}.mock-menu h2{font-size:28px}.side-panel{padding:18px 10px}.gallery-controls button{padding:12px 8px}.gallery-controls button span{margin-left:5px}}@media(max-width:800px){.pack-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.product-summary{max-width:650px}.overview,.specs{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.contents-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.contents-grid article{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px}.flow-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.forge-band{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.detail-section{padding:45px 0}.section-nav{gap:15px 22px}.product-summary h1{font-size:48px}}@media(max-width:480px){.concept-board{padding:18px;min-height:440px;gap:26px}.screen-composition{grid-template-columns:1fr}.side-panel{display:none}.board-top,.board-bottom{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.5px}.mock-menu h2{font-size:31px}.component-sheet,.state-sheet{gap:18px 12px}.mock-option{padding:10px 8px;font-size:10px}.sample-panel{padding:10px}.sample-panel h3{font-size:18px}.tiny{font-size:8px}.product-summary h1{font-size:42px}.detail-section h2,.forge-band h2{font-size:33px}.forge-band{padding:26px}.related>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
